# BANNERFALL: without a unit in hand the cursor roams only your own half of
# the field (your four columns); in 2P the violet hand keeps to its half.
game bannerfall
wait 5
cheat battle 1
cheat clear
expect cx == 1
press RIGHT
press RIGHT
expect cx == 3
press RIGHT
press RIGHT
expect cx == 3
press LEFT
press LEFT
press LEFT
press LEFT
expect cx == 0
press UP
press UP
press UP
expect cy == 0
cheat versus 0
cheat clear
expect cx2 == 6
press P2LEFT
press P2LEFT
press P2LEFT
expect cx2 == 4
press P2RIGHT
press P2RIGHT
press P2RIGHT
press P2RIGHT
expect cx2 == 7
